        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_024",
        "name2": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been by my side for fifteen years, but you've learned nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you've managed to pick up are some unsavory tactics. What a dullard you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_024",
        "name2": "avg_npc_023_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dullard? Ahaha... Ahahahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old man, surely you didn't expect me to be out of moves already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$smallearthquake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... Could it be the earthquake preceding the eruption?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$volcano_intro",
        "key": "$volcano_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac3_volcano",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahaha, come! It's finally here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Turn into ashes along with this city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac3_volcano2",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late now! Even if you take control of the broadcast tower, the people will only start panicking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The volcano is about to erupt, but what can you possibly accomplish with that 'data' of yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I control all the escape passages! None of you are going to get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You bloody hypocrites can't save anyone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything will be burnt to nothingness, along with the city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_Festival_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, what do we do?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Get all the operators to help with the evacuation, now!;At least get everyone to where it's safe!",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, should we mobilize the entirety of Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, can you hear me? I've finished analyzing the volcano!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we act now, we can still buy more time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, we've already determined the underlying cause of the volcano's activity. There's a good possibility that we might be able to stop the eruption!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, please stay calm and listen closely. If you follow my instructions, we will be able to delay the eruption!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can definitely help, if it's really something within our power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, please let us handle this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cronin has been plotting this for a long time. His henchmen must be all over the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the critical moment. Schwarz, Mister Hellagur, you have your own duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can leave those things to the others...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But this is our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_024"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ceylon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agreed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're Catastrophe Messengers, volcanologists, and Originium researchers. None of us will just sit and watch while peoples' lives are threatened by something predictable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's more, there are people who would use their knowledge to deceive others and line their own pockets. As a Catastrophe Messenger, I can't tolerate seeing people like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen you get this serious before, but I understand. In any case, Mayor, allow us to aid you with the evacuation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_024",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Very well. Schwarz, you should come too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_024",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_024",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ceylon said she can handle this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Milady, please be careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have we finished deciding? We don't have much time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay! Let's get going right now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_024",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We should trust her. Besides, what she said was right. We each have our own duty to fulfill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gahahaha! They're just rushing towards death! Even if they manage to buy an hour or two, so what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your daughter is going to get buried along with most of this city, and you won't even be able to find her body...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 18,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Guh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I couldn't control myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_024",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. He's right about the threat this poses. We can't afford to endanger the citizens any longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please lend me your assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
